====================================================================================================
SIGNAL-BOUNDING PROPERTY: does the estimator enclose the TRUE wave speeds?
An estimator that does not lets signal leave the control volume. This is the
correctness requirement on the estimate -- not accuracy -- so it is gateable.
====================================================================================================
