The denominator bound is unaffected by the choice: q_K >= 1 gives
(S_L - u_nL) = -a_L q_L <= -a_L and (S_R - u_nR) = +a_R q_R >= +a_R, so
denom <= -(rho_L a_L + rho_R a_R) holds for BOTH estimators.
